, the narrator takes us on a poignant quest, from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MyOyaJC6_7UQ7kNvwEmSyoE&_nc_oc=Adr-H6wvE2rzQxhXt00Xvf5je-Y43NmKh4X4Kx7QP0a_-_3yqYMYFecdjNBTDsBnBFI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQF5OOkYAXeUAJrYYkNPga5b8etw-MfnIhjL3RLmfJt2Vg&oe=6A8ECB81"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sVh3gcFuPSUQ7kNvwHvmER4&_nc_oc=Adp1RweRPZcZ-LrC58YlxfEMAIDt3FFCGCn3G-Al3pE-kpQPJvfnsJegBiJ3A8L56vw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHMx95v2JM1Hn0dhq4YttX29LppDsjtLYGNl1bwnwEK9A&oe=6A8ED8E6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Cfd7zRUpfUcQ7kNvwELTro5&_nc_oc=AdqqwYIdZPvQbgbRluvijBJwDyfJWmI7py_H5bfl2JmhJFm91a06IacXRtYAZUbetQQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGhOPW79uz3KmpNQRWba